# Production build config. Loaded only by `vite build`.
#
# CAP service: VITE_API_BASE_URL is deliberately unset, so the frontend calls
# the relative path /odata/v4/invoice-automation. The server module proxies
# that through the BTP destination MarathonInvoiceAutomation-srv-api, keeping
# the CAP URL and its credentials server-side.
#
# VITE_API_TOKEN is pinned empty on purpose: it overrides anything set in
# .env or .env.local, so a stray dev token can never be inlined into the
# shipped bundle. Do not give this a value.
